Patch 11 (2026-10-29, built, SDK rebuilt): rex_xr_sample_buttons, the controllers as an Xbox pad.

On top of patch 10. The dk_hands action set gets a/b/x/y, menu, the stick clicks (boolean), trigger and
squeeze (float, both hands) and the thumbstick (vec2, both hands); each profile is suggested the bindings
it has (Touch and Index the full set, simple/Vive/WMR what they can). rex_xr_sample_buttons(buttons, axes[6])
syncs the set itself and answers XInput bits + lt rt lx ly rx ry. The game side lays it over the bridge pad
(port-project/src/vr_bridge.cpp, BridgePadDriver), merged with the real pad by the input system.

